  {
   "name": "clock_start",
   "display": "setting.clock_start",
   "type": "datetime",
   "default": 1495889068,
   "min": 946684800,
   "max": 4102444799,
   "description": "setting.clock_start.about"
  }
 ],
 "_firmware_note": "The console's four shared fonts (system title 0005001b-10042400), which games ask the console for, in two pinned variants a setting chooses between: Cemu's copies (the four files upstream Cemu ships) and the console's (the four files of that title). With the Console Fonts setting on the stand-in (the default) no font is needed and Cemu's own stand-in (the free font Lato) is given to games (owner, 2026-11-04). The console's Mii resource (system title 0005001b-10056000, its four files), needed with the Mii Resource setting on the console's (the default) (owner, 2026-11-03). The Wii U common key, needed for a game given as a zip of its NUS folder (owner, 2026-11-03). Nintendo's fonts, Mii resource and keys are never in this package.",
